# SfxLab bench v1: layer id name type dur seed key=value... (dur 0 = endless) · range id param lo hi [note] · bind signal id|* param [lo hi] [rel] [steps=N | scale=<chord>]
# aqueous_mystic — the aqueous plan bent away from the real thing. Same recordings, same subtraction (four bandpasses at the chord
# tones, levels from tone.*), but nothing plays at the speed it was recorded: the surface runs at a third to nine tenths of real
# time (keep-len, the pen's speed), the note copies are slowed an octave in tape mode (big slow drops), the rumble is stretched
# and cleaned of its inharmonics (an underwater organ). The filters ring harder (resonance 0.9-0.97) and the notes echo. The
# droplets (the stream's partials, always gathered onto the chord, shimmering) grow with the machine and FREEZE as the ratios
# come in tune: at coherence 1 the water stands still (spectral freeze). Reverbs wide, echo on the drips.
bench 1
root 65.4064
layer bed aqueous/Aqueous_underwater_rumbling_00001 7 0.0000 5001 level=0.60000 attack=1.20000 release=1.80000 pitch=4.42000 cutoff=0.50000 echo=0.00000 reverb=0.45000 drive=0.10000 loop=1.00000 speed=0.70000 sines=1.00000 residual=0.60000 purity=0.30000 stretch=0.04000 keyed=1 file=aqueous/Aqueous_underwater_rumbling_00001.ogg
layer surface aqueous/Aqueous_stream_00001 5 0.0000 5002 level=0.00000 attack=1.00000 release=1.50000 pitch=0.00000 cutoff=0.70000 echo=0.25000 reverb=0.45000 drive=0.12000 loop=1.00000 pitch_mode=1.00000 speed=0.60000 flange=0.30000 flange_fb=0.60000 lfo_rate=0.15000 keyed=2 file=aqueous/Aqueous_stream_00001.ogg
layer root aqueous/Aqueous_stream_00001 5 0.0000 5003 level=0.00000 attack=0.60000 release=1.20000 pitch=-12.00000 filter=1.00000 cutoff=0.34020 resonance=0.93000 echo=0.30000 reverb=0.45000 drive=0.08000 loop=1.00000 keyed=2 file=aqueous/Aqueous_stream_00001.ogg
layer third aqueous/Aqueous_stream_00001 5 0.0000 5004 level=0.00000 attack=0.60000 release=1.20000 pitch=-12.00000 filter=1.00000 cutoff=0.38200 resonance=0.93000 echo=0.30000 reverb=0.45000 drive=0.08000 loop=1.00000 keyed=2 file=aqueous/Aqueous_stream_00001.ogg
layer fifth aqueous/Aqueous_stream_00001 5 0.0000 5005 level=0.00000 attack=0.60000 release=1.20000 pitch=-12.00000 filter=1.00000 cutoff=0.41340 resonance=0.93000 echo=0.30000 reverb=0.45000 drive=0.08000 loop=1.00000 keyed=2 file=aqueous/Aqueous_stream_00001.ogg
layer seventh aqueous/Aqueous_stream_00001 5 0.0000 5006 level=0.00000 attack=0.60000 release=1.20000 pitch=-12.00000 filter=1.00000 cutoff=0.44480 resonance=0.93000 echo=0.30000 reverb=0.45000 drive=0.08000 loop=1.00000 keyed=2 file=aqueous/Aqueous_stream_00001.ogg
layer droplets aqueous/Aqueous_stream_00001 7 0.0000 5007 level=0.00000 attack=1.50000 release=2.50000 pitch=0.00000 cutoff=1.00000 echo=0.20000 reverb=0.80000 loop=1.00000 speed=1.00000 sines=1.00000 residual=0.00000 gather=1.00000 chord=2.00000 shimmer=0.30000 root_shift=-5.00000 keyed=1 file=aqueous/Aqueous_stream_00001.ogg
layer thud aqueous/Aqueous_impact_splash_00001 5 5.0000 5008 level=0.30000 attack=0.00500 release=0.30000 pitch=-5.00000 cutoff=0.70000 reverb=0.60000 keyed=2 on=lock file=aqueous/Aqueous_impact_splash_00001.ogg
layer drip aqueous/Aqueous_drip_00001 5 3.0000 5009 level=0.40000 attack=0.00200 release=0.20000 pitch=0.07000 cutoff=1.00000 echo=0.50000 reverb=0.50000 keyed=1 on=accept file=aqueous/Aqueous_drip_00001.ogg
layer splash aqueous/Aqueous_splash_00002 5 6.0000 5010 level=0.30000 attack=0.00500 release=0.30000 pitch=-7.00000 cutoff=0.70000 reverb=0.60000 keyed=2 on=unlock file=aqueous/Aqueous_splash_00002.ogg
range bed level 0.3 0.6 the rumble as an underwater organ: stretched to 0.7x, inharmonics faded (purity 0.3), a little bell stretch
range surface level 0 0.35 the stream in slow motion (0.35x .. 0.9x of real time, the pen's speed), flanged, echoing
range surface speed 0.35 0.9 never real time
range surface flange 0.1 0.6 the orb's curl
range root level 0 0.45 the root: the stream slowed an octave (tape) through a bandpass at C4 that rings (resonance 0.9-0.97 from fit), echoing
range root resonance 0.9 0.97
range third level 0 0.4 E4
range fifth level 0 0.4 G4
range seventh level 0 0.3 Bb4
range droplets level 0 1 the droplets, always gathered onto the chord, shimmering: grow with the machine
range droplets speed 0.05 1 time itself: real at coherence 0, all but frozen (spectral freeze) at coherence 1
bind stir bed level 0.6 0.4
bind stack bed level 0 -0.12 rel
bind orb.radius bed cutoff 0.35 0.65
bind stir surface level 0 0.35
bind orb.speed surface speed 0.35 0.9
bind orb.curl surface flange 0.1 0.6
bind orb.radius surface cutoff 0.5 1
bind tone.root root level 0 0.45
bind tone.third third level 0 0.4
bind tone.fifth fifth level 0 0.4
bind tone.seventh seventh level 0 0.3
bind fit root resonance 0.9 0.97
bind fit third resonance 0.9 0.97
bind fit fifth resonance 0.9 0.97
bind fit seventh resonance 0.9 0.97
bind orb.accel root drive 0.08 0.2
bind orb.accel fifth drive 0.08 0.2
bind stack droplets level 0 1
bind coherence droplets speed 1 0.05
bind radiance droplets reverb 0.6 0.95
note aqueous_mystic (draft, 2026-09-27): the aqueous v1 plan with time bent. Compare with aqueous in the family picker; the spells are copies
note of aqueous's (same layer ids), so a spell file can be shared or diverged later. Levers used, in order of how far they take it from
note the recording: droplets speed (freeze with coherence) > note copies an octave down in tape mode > surface keep-len slow motion +
note flange > bed purity/stretch/0.7x > resonance 0.9-0.97 > echo on the notes and the drip > reverbs. All of it is authoring, no new samples.
